OFFICIAL DEMOLITION ORDER — UTTAR PRADESH URBAN PLANNING & DEVELOPMENT ACT 1973 (SECTION 27)
WHEREAS unauthorized construction and permanent concrete plinths spanning 31,800 m² (~12.57 Bigha) have been detected via satellite telemetry at Coordinates (26.81437° N, 81.01223° E) within the prohibited Gomti River Floodplain buffer;
NOW THEREFORE, notice is hereby served upon all unauthorized occupants and developers to CEASE all construction forthwith and remove all materials within 48 HOURS of this notice. In default, summary demolition will be executed by the LDA Enforcement Squad at your sole risk, cost, and penal liability under law.

STATUTORY ENFORCEMENT & REMOVAL NOTICE — UP FOREST & URBAN PLANNING ACT
WHEREAS illegal deforestation and structural encroachment across 20,900 m² has been detected within the Kukrail Reserve Forest Buffer at GPS Coordinates (26.90505° N, 81.00942° E);
YOU ARE HEREBY DIRECTED to vacate the protected forest land immediately. Failure to comply within 48 hours shall invite summary eviction and registration of Non-Bailable Cognizable Offenses under the Forest Conservation Act.

